<title>UK: SGZ-Bank adds 100 mln marks to REX-linked bond.</title>
<headline>SGZ-Bank adds 100 mln marks to REX-linked bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been</p>
<p>increased to 300 million marks fron 200 million marks, lead</p>
<p>manager SGZ-Bank said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SGZ-BANK AG</p>
<p> AMT   *300 MLN DEM   COUPON   **5.60	MATURITY    21.MAY.07</p>
<p> TYPE   REX-LINKED    ISS PRICE  100.0     PAY DATE    21.MAY.97</p>
<p> LISTING    FFT	 DENOMS (K) 1	   GOV LAW     GERMAN</p>
<p> NOTES   *ORIGINALLY LAUNCHED FOR 200 MLN MARKS ON 06.MAY.97.</p>
<p>	  **FOR TWO YEARS, THEN LINKED TO 10-YEAR REX SUBINDEX</p>
<p>	    STARTING WITH 81 PERCENT OF THE 10-YEAR REX SUBINDEX</p>
<p>	    IN THE THIRD YEAR, DECREASING BY 1.0 PERCENTAGE POINT</p>
<p>	    PER YEAR AND ENDING UP IN THE TENTH YEAR WITH</p>
<p>	    74 PERCENT OF THE 10 YEAR REX SUBINDEX.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
